From 74d0d34938349beb19b7fc60d5b138ffc91fd1b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nex <63727521+LuCiLuna@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:06:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 040/110] fixup! clk: qcom: add SM8350 camera clock controller

Vote MXC as well as MMCX, use the core use_rpm/driver_data probe, park the
RCGs downstream marks enable_safe_config on XO (clk_rcg2_shared_ops) and
use the SC7280 GDSC timings without CFG polling. Without the parked RCGs
the IFE GDSCs never power up again after their first collapse.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
